IMPORT `uic-autojoy-test-fixtures`

-- THE HOSTILE READING: evidence for the findings in NOTES.md §4. Each assertion here states
-- the SURPRISING answer the instrument gives, and is satisfied: it documents the defect, it
-- does not endorse it. The finding numbers (V1, V2, ...) are NOTES.md's. Findings the
-- encoding cannot demonstrate are marked "reading only" there and have nothing here.

§ `Findings — the evidence`

§§ `V1 — costs on top of a total loss break the "in every case" cap of Art 12.1`

-- Sum insured 500.000.000 = market value; total loss; deductible the 500.000 minimum; costs
-- of 25.000.000 and 25.000.000 on UIC's instructions. Art 10.2.3 pays the costs "in addition
-- to" the total-loss compensation: 499.500.000 + 50.000.000 = 549.500.000, more than the
-- sum insured that Art 12.1 says total compensation "in every case" does not exceed.
-- src:335 | 2.3. Đối với tổn thất toàn bộ thuộc phạm vi bảo hiểm, ngoài số tiền bồi thường toàn bộ, UIC sẽ chi trả các
