    `the standard policy with instalments` (LIST (`an instalment due` (YMD 2026 1 1) `of` 5_475_000 `, paid by then` 5_475_000), (`an instalment due` (YMD 2026 7 1) `of` 5_475_000 `, paid by then` 0)) `, owing allowed` TRUE

